## Pre-computation script pattern

**Reference:** `scripts/generate-sample-answers.mjs`

| Item | Convention |
|------|------------|
| Script path | `scripts/generate-[module]-answers.mjs` |
| npm script | `npm run generate:answers` (see `package.json`) |
| Input | `public/data/samples.json` |
| Output | `public/data/sample-answers.json` |
| Env | Reads `.env.local` for `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` |
| Model | Same as production Sonnet (not Opus) |
| Idempotent | Saves after each item — safe to resume |

**Use when content is:**
1. Deterministic (fixed sample set)
2. Called repeatedly (demo flow)
3. Expensive at runtime (Mood 1 full analysis)

**Do NOT pre-compute** user-pasted unique questions.

