## PMP question source types

```typescript
type QuestionSource = 'sample' | 'uploaded' | 'manual'
```

| Source | When set |
|--------|----------|
| `sample` | Feature cards, sidebar mood start |
| `manual` | Pasted text via `InputScreen` |
| `uploaded` | Reserved — OCR/paste currently uses `manual` |

Always pass `sampleId` index when `source === 'sample'` for cache lookup.

