## Data collection readiness

Every product module must eventually log enough to analyze user behavior.

**Minimum per session:** mood/mode, timing, input source, outcome correctness, AI result JSON.

**Current TODOs in codebase:**
- `LessonScreen` report modal → `pmp_reports` table
- `PMPClient` → call `/api/pmp/sessions` on submit/complete
- Analytics events — TODO comments only (no SDK yet)

When adding features, leave `// TODO: analytics — [event_name]` at decision points.

---

## API routes rules (data-related)

- All routes in `src/app/api/`
- Validate request body before processing
- Return `{ data, error }` — never raw throws to client
- Rate limiting: TODO comments until implemented

---

## Caching rules

- Client cache: React state + optional `useRef` for imperative handles
- Sample cache: single fetch on mount in `PMPClient`
- Translation cache: per-component `translateCache` state; seed from `sample-answers.json` when available
- No localStorage for AI results unless explicitly requested

---

## File loading anti-patterns

- ❌ Import large JSON directly in client components (bundles size) — prefer `fetch('/data/...')` for big files
- ✅ `glossary.json` imported in `glossaryTerms.ts` for sync highlight regex build (acceptable — glossary size bounded)
- ❌ Hardcode glossary counts — use `GLOSSARY_PAIR_COUNT` / `GLOSSARY_TERM_COUNT`
